%% frame: Pay upfront B3: create the Stripe page, transaction 2 (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant PBS as :PaymentBrowserService
    participant Svc as :StripeCheckoutService
    participant Repo as :CheckoutPaymentRepository
    participant Port as :PaymentBusinessPort
    participant Pay as :CheckoutPayment
    participant GW as :StripeCheckoutGateway
    actor Stripe

    Note over Svc,Stripe: B3: outside any transaction, no row lock held during the Stripe call
    alt session already bound (A3)
        Svc->>GW: retrieveCheckoutSession(sessionId)
        GW->>Stripe: GET /v1/checkout/sessions/{id}
        Stripe-->>GW: Session
        GW-->>Svc: CheckoutGateway.Session
    else created 55 s ago or more without a session (A5)
        Svc->>Repo: review(id, "CREATE_UNKNOWN", "system"): own short tx
        Svc-->>PBS: PAYMENT_STATE_INVALID
    else new session
        Svc->>GW: createCheckoutSession(payment)
        GW->>Pay: providerKey()
        Pay-->>GW: blocbuy-checkout-id
        GW->>Stripe: POST /v1/checkout/sessions, Idempotency-Key
        Stripe-->>GW: Session
        GW-->>Svc: CheckoutGateway.Session, or PAYMENT_PROVIDER_ERROR (A5)
    end
    Svc->>Svc: bindAndReturn(id, session)
    critical tx 2: REQUIRED, READ COMMITTED, 10 s
        Svc->>Repo: findById(id)
        Repo-->>Svc: Optional of CheckoutPayment
        Svc->>Port: lockForSettlement(quote): lock 1 team, lock 2 intent
        Svc->>Repo: lock(id): lock 3, the payment row
        Repo-->>Svc: CheckoutPayment
        Svc->>Svc: matches(current, session)
        break session does not match the saved payment
            Svc-->>PBS: PAYMENT_STATE_INVALID
        end
        Svc->>Pay: bind(session.id, session.url, session.paymentIntentId)
        Pay-->>Svc: CheckoutPayment
        Svc->>Repo: save(bound)
        alt no longer CREATED, session not open, quote expired or no URL (A6)
            Svc-->>PBS: CheckoutResult(id, null, status)
        else https://checkout.stripe.com page (B3)
            Svc-->>PBS: CheckoutResult(id, checkoutUrl, "CREATED")
        end
    end
    Note over PBS,Svc: B4: the controller returns the URL; the browser goes to Stripe
